 ## Overview
-Cached SDF accelerates Signed Distance Field queries by storing quantized distance values in a voxel grid, falling back to a ground truth SDF for points outside the cache [S2, unofficial]. It differs from standard SDF primitives by trading far-field precision for significant memory savings and query speed, using Int8 quantization to compress the field [S1, unofficial].
